# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# /download is the stable, memorable link to the newest release asset, the same alias the other
# Killer app sites carry. It depends on the release asset staying named KillerShot.exe. It will
# 404 until the first public release exists.
#
# 302, not 301: a permanent redirect would be cached by browsers and proxies, and the target is
# only "permanent" until the next release. 302 keeps the alias re-resolving.
/download   https://github.com/SteveTheKiller/KillerShot/releases/latest/download/KillerShot.exe   302
/download/  https://github.com/SteveTheKiller/KillerShot/releases/latest/download/KillerShot.exe   302
